  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Get Pick of the Day Archive"
 },
 "description": "Get the complete Pick of the Day track record: every published pick with its settled outcome (win, loss, void, or pending), the frozen backed price, unit score, and CLV fields, plus the rolling hit rate (wins / decided; void and pending excluded) and the flat-$1,000-stake profit and ROI (`hit_rate.stake_usd` names the stake). The actual API key tier controls unresolved access: Pro reads ranks 1\u20135 and Max all available ranks, up to fifteen. Every resolved outcome (win/loss/void) is public. Unentitled pending rows retain only slot/date/outcome and required_tier with backed_side_locked=true; matchup, category, league, image, publication clock and all backed facts are omitted. The archive retains the complete historical record, losses included.\n\nArgs: none\n\nReturns: picks[] newest first with outcome and CLV fields, plus the aggregate record (hit_rate, decided, wins, losses, voids, profit, roi, total risked).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {},
  "type": "object"
 },
